rismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIX5bqstJ98uao_Asia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=6%2C0%2C2988%2C1993&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIX5bqstJ98uao_Asia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=6%2C0%2C2988%2C1993&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIX5bqstJ98uao_Asia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=6%2C0%2C2988%2C1993&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Sending parcels to Asia</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Asia is the world’s largest continent, so you&#39;ll need a shipping service you can rely on to reach your parcel’s destination quickly and safely. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Every time you <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/asia" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->send a parcel to Asia<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or any destination with us, you get full tracking included to give you visibility from start to finish. Plus, our network covers more than 30 Asian countries to increase your options and reach internationally. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out some of our most popular Asian destinations below for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Selle